<title>USA: Ahmanson says Wash Mutual statement baseless.</title>
<headline>Ahmanson says Wash Mutual statement baseless.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F. Ahmanson and Co said its stock buy-back program, announced March 26, is consistent with its long-standing policy and practice and that of numerous other financial institutions.</p>
<p>Earlier, Washington Mutual Savings Inc, which has agreed to merge with Great Western Financial Corp, criticized rival bidder Ahmanson for what it said was delayed admission by Ahmanson of a share buyback.</p>
<p>Ahmanson said Washington Mutual's suggestions are baseless and self-serving.</p>
</text>
